This skill is adapted from the `humanizer` plugin by blader / Siqi Chen
(https://github.com/blader/humanizer), harvested 2026-08-22. That plugin is MIT-licensed;
its license text is reproduced below and applies to the material this fork's structure and
teaching taxonomy are derived from. The underlying pattern taxonomy traces further back to
Wikipedia's "Signs of AI writing" guide (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wikipedia:Signs_of_AI_writing),
maintained by WikiProject AI Cleanup, itself released under CC BY-SA.

The body of `SKILL.md` in this fork is an independent rewrite: the pattern categories and
overall before/after teaching method are carried over, but the descriptions and every
example pair are freshly written rather than copied, and the frontmatter/invocation shape
was adapted to this machine's skill conventions (see `~/Development/Development Base/.claude/TOOLING.md` for the
harvest note).

